'''Etherwarp Conduit''' can be used to teleport to a block up to {{Green|57 blocks}} away, which can be increased via {{Item|Transmission Tuner}}s to up to {{Green|61 blocks}}. The item itself can be applied {{Item|Aspect of the End}} or {{Item|Aspect of the Void}} using the recipe seen below. When the ability is applied to these two items, it does not require {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 7}} to be used, which is likely an oversight. When the ability is used, particles similar to Voidgloom Seraph's Hitshield spawn and rise wherever the player is standing originally. At the same time, it teleports its user to the top surface of the block they are looking at. 

It can only be aimed at a block, above which there are 2 blocks. It can be used to teleport through one block ceiling, which can be used in Dungeons. Similarly to other mobility abilities, it does not work in [[The Catacombs - Floor VII]] boss room. The ability has no cooldown and costs {{Stat|slfw|1}} and {{Stat|mana|180}} to use.

=== Crafting ===
It can be combined with an {{Item|Aspect of the End}} or {{Item|Aspect of the Void}} using an [[Etherwarp Merger]]. This transfers its ability to the weapon, allowing its user to use it by right clicking while sneaking. Transferring its ability requires {{Coll|Enderman Slayer LVL 7}}, however using the resulting {{Item|Aspect of the End}} or {{Item|Aspect of the Void}} does not.
